"Divine Order":"Choose Protector (Martial weapons and Heavy armor) or Thaumaturge (extra cantrip, bonus to Arcana and Religion checks).",
"Channel Divinity":"Channel divine energy: Divine Spark (roll 1d8 + WIS to heal or damage a nearby creature) or Turn Undead (undead within 30 ft save or flee). 2 uses, scaling up; regain on rests.",
"Life Domain":"Cleric subclass: healing magic. Disciple of Life adds 2 + spell level HP to your healing spells.",
"Sear Undead":"When you use Turn Undead, roll a number of d8s equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum 1). Each Undead that fails its save takes that much Radiant damage.",
"Blessed Strikes":"Choose Divine Strike (+1d8 weapon damage) or Potent Spellcasting (+WIS modifier to cantrip damage).",
"Divine Intervention":"Cast any Cleric spell of level 5 or lower without a slot, 1/Long Rest.",
"Improved Blessed Strikes":"Divine Strike improves to 2d8, or Potent Spellcasting also grants temp HP.",
