// Druid
"Druidic":"You know the secret language of druids and always have Speak with Animals prepared.",
"Primal Order":"Choose Magician (extra cantrip, bonus to Arcana and Nature) or Warden (Martial weapons, Medium armor).",
"Wild Shape":"Bonus Action: transform into a Beast form (CR and abilities scale with level) for hours; 2+ uses per Long Rest.",
"Wild Companion":"Expend a spell slot or Wild Shape use to cast Find Familiar as a ritual.",
"Circle of the Land":"Druid subclass: nature magic of a chosen terrain grants bonus prepared spells and Natural Recovery (regain slots on Short Rest).",
"Wild Resurgence":"Trade spell slots for Wild Shape uses and vice versa (once per turn / 1 per Long Rest).",
"Elemental Fury":"Choose Potent Spellcasting (+WIS to cantrip damage) or Primal Strike (+1d8 elemental damage on attacks in or out of Wild Shape).",
