"Heightened Focus":"Flurry of Blows gains a third strike; Patient Defense and Step of the Wind improve.",
"Deflect Energy":"Deflect Attacks works against any damage type.",
"Disciplined Survivor":"Proficiency in all saving throws; reroll a failed save for a Focus Point.",
"Perfect Focus":"Regain Focus Points (up to 4) when you roll Initiative with 3 or fewer.",
"Superior Defense":"Spend 3 Focus Points: 1 minute of Resistance to all damage except Force.",
"Body and Mind":"DEX and WIS increase by 4, maximum 25.",
