"Lay On Hands":"A pool of 5 × Paladin level HP; as a Bonus Action touch to heal or spend 5 to remove Poisoned. Refills on Long Rest.",
"Paladin's Smite":"Always have Divine Smite prepared: expend a slot on a hit for +2d8 radiant (scaling), 1 free cast per Long Rest.",
"Oath of Devotion":"Paladin subclass: honor and duty. Sacred Weapon adds CHA to attack rolls; oath spells like Protection from Evil and Good.",
"Faithful Steed":"Always have Find Steed prepared; 1 free cast per Long Rest.",
"Aura of Protection":"You and allies within 10 ft add your CHA modifier to saving throws.",
"Abjure Foes":"Spend a Channel Divinity use: frighten enemies within 60 ft (WIS save).",
