"Radiant Strikes":"Your weapon and unarmed strikes deal +1d8 radiant damage.",
"Restoring Touch":"Lay On Hands can also remove Blinded, Charmed, Deafened, Frightened, Paralyzed, or Stunned (5 HP each).",
"Aura Expansion":"Your auras extend to 30 feet.",
// Ranger
"Favored Enemy":"Always have Hunter's Mark prepared, with free casts per Long Rest (scaling).",
"Deft Explorer":"Expertise in one skill; learn two languages.",
"Hunter":"Ranger subclass: Hunter's Prey grants Colossus Slayer (+1d8 vs wounded targets) or Horde Breaker (extra attack vs adjacent second target).",
"Roving":"+10 ft Speed and a Climb Speed and Swim Speed equal to your Speed.",
"Tireless":"Give yourself temp HP (1d8 + WIS) several times per day; Short Rests reduce Exhaustion.",
"Relentless Hunter":"Taking damage can't break your Concentration on Hunter's Mark.",
"Nature's Veil":"Bonus Action: become Invisible until your next turn, WIS-modifier uses per Long Rest.",
