"Cunning Action":"Bonus Action: Dash, Disengage, or Hide.",
"Thief":"Rogue subclass: Fast Hands (Sleight of Hand or Utilize as a Bonus Action) and Second-Story Work (Climb Speed, longer jumps).",
"Steady Aim":"Bonus Action: give yourself Advantage on your next attack roll this turn if you don't move.",
"Cunning Strike":"Trade Sneak Attack dice for effects: Poison (1d6), Trip (1d6), Withdraw (1d6).",
"Uncanny Dodge":"Reaction: halve the damage of an attack from an attacker you can see.",
"Reliable Talent":"Treat d20 rolls of 9 or lower as a 10 on checks using skills or tools you're proficient with.",
"Improved Cunning Strike":"Use two Cunning Strike effects on one Sneak Attack.",
